		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Gnome illusionist who loves deceiving and tricking foes.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 22, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 dagger +3 (1d6) or 1 spell +5, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> -1, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> -1, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Duplicates (INT Spell)</strong>. DC 12. Create 2 illusory duplicates that disappear when hit. Determine randomly if an attack hits prankster or illusions. Lasts for 5 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Mask (INT Spell)</strong>. DC 12. Take on the illusory appearance of a humanoid for 5 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Phantasm (INT Spell)</strong>. DC 12. Create a convincing audiovisual illusion within near. Lasts 5 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Read Minds (INT Spell)</strong>. DC 12. Read the mind of a creature within near.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
